<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>只寫一行的宇宙</title><link>https://ortho099.github.io/one-line-universe-read/</link><description>從一個家的日常，寄往另一個時空。每週一封粵語奇幻來信。</description><language>zh-Hant-HK</language><atom:link href="https://ortho099.github.io/one-line-universe-read/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>第03封信：空凳</title><link>https://ortho099.github.io/one-line-universe-read/letters/empty-chair/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://ortho099.github.io/one-line-universe-read/letters/empty-chair/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description>父子試探薄紙上的背影，卻認出一張本來不在枱邊的舊矮凳。他們暫時不改畫，先留一個空位。</description></item><item><title>第02封信：薄紙</title><link>https://ortho099.github.io/one-line-universe-read/letters/tracing-paper/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://ortho099.github.io/one-line-universe-read/letters/tracing-paper/</guid><pubDate>Sat, 24 Oct 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description>父子用十年前的描字薄紙，留住一道不停改變的門。描得越清楚，兩人越不確定自己正在幫誰。</description></item><item><title>第01封信：膠布</title><link>https://ortho099.github.io/one-line-universe-read/letters/plaster/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://ortho099.github.io/one-line-universe-read/letters/plaster/</guid><pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 13:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description>一本十年前的日記，出現了仍然稚嫩的字跡。對面的細路，只想知道爸爸有沒有帶齊東西。</description></item></channel></rss>